      "9": {
        "attributes": {
          "font-size": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 19
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "IS NOTE ON/OFF\n\nThese nodes give us a boolean when the incomming midi data is a note on or a note off.\n\nThe node will by default interpet a velocity of 0 as a node off signal.\nDepending on your MIDI device you might want to turn this on or off.\n\nIn this example we check if the incomming MIID Data has a Note On or off. In case of a Note Off we bypass the effect, in case of a Note On we turn the bypass of. Creating an on-key effect."
          }
        },
        "bounds": {
          "height": 236.68818664550776,
          "width": 484.3928833007813,
          "x": 230.53976440429688,
          "y": 139.07383728027344
        },
